@startuml seq-delivery
actor Android
participant Spring
database PostgreSQL
Android -> Spring: GET /api/deliveries
Spring -> PostgreSQL: today CONFIRMED or MOBILISED
Android -> Spring: PATCH deliveries MOBILISED
note over Spring: CONFIRMED to MOBILISED only
Android -> Spring: GET /api/returns
Android -> Spring: PATCH returns COMPLETED
note over Spring: MOBILISED to COMPLETED only
@enduml
